{"discussions":[{"id":"78c7f590-a5ff-11f1-8080-80004615e1b3","post":{"id":"78c7f590-a5ff-11f1-8080-80004615e1b3","owner":{"id":"36864868","username":"21Shares-Flows","firstName":"Crypto","lastName":"Monthly Market Flows","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/36653448/2.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/36653448/2.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/36653448/2.jpg"},"roles":["eTorian","CopyPortfolio","Verified","Regular"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":54,"piLevel":0},"obsoleteId":"b85aeec7-69f0-4ec6-a5f5-106f3536d4e3","created":"2026-09-01T12:20:08.681Z","message":{"text":"📊 21Shares-Flows Portfolio Rebalanced 🔄\n\nIn line with August flows into European crypto ETPs, the 21Shares-Flows Portfolio has been rebalanced to reflect a sharp return to Bitcoin core dominance alongside targeted exposure to high-growth infrastructure. $BTC  surged from 46.6% back up to 72.1% 🚀, reclaiming its position as the dominant portfolio anchor. Meanwhile, $ETH  saw its weight trimmed from 19.9% to 10.7%.\n\nTo accommodate Bitcoin's rebound, several August altcoin allocations were scaled back or exited, with Solana trimmed from 11.6% to 4.4% and positions in $LDO  $ONDO  , $UNI  and Toncoin liquidated. However, capital was selectively redirected into key infrastructure assets: $HYPE   returned strongly at 6.5% ⚡, while $LINK  (2.3%), $MORPHO  (1.8%), $XRP  (1.5%), and $BCH  (0.7%) round out the allocations.\n\n📊 Poll: What's your take on this rebalance?\n\n🔵 Bullish — BTC dominance is the right call\n🟡 Neutral — waiting to see how it plays out\n🔴 Bearish — should've kept more altcoin exposure","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-09-01T12:20:08.681Z","isDeleted":false,"type":"Poll","metadata":{"poll":{"id":235218,"title":"📊 21Shares-Flows Portfolio Rebalanced 🔄\n\nIn line with August flows into European crypto ETPs, the 21Shares-Flows Portfolio has been rebalanced to reflect a sharp return to Bitcoin core dominance alongside targeted exposure to high-growth infrastructure. $BTC  surged from 46.6% back up to 72.1% 🚀, reclaiming its position as the dominant portfolio anchor. Meanwhile, $ETH  saw its weight trimmed from 19.9% to 10.7%.\n\nTo accommodate Bitcoin's rebound, several August altcoin allocations were scaled back or exited, with Solana trimmed from 11.6% to 4.4% and positions in $LDO  $ONDO  , $UNI  and Toncoin liquidated. However, capital was selectively redirected into key infrastructure assets: $HYPE   returned strongly at 6.5% ⚡, while $LINK  (2.3%), $MORPHO  (1.8%), $XRP  (1.5%), and $BCH  (0.7%) round out the allocations.\n\n📊 Poll: What's your take on this rebalance?\n\n🔵 Bullish — BTC dominance is the right call\n🟡 Neutral — waiting to see how it plays out\n🔴 Bearish — should've kept more altcoin exposure","gcid":36864868,"options":[{"id":748157,"index":1,"text":"🔵 Bullish ","isUserVoted":false,"votesCount":82},{"id":748158,"index":2,"text":"🟡 Neutral ","isUserVoted":false,"votesCount":43},{"id":748159,"index":3,"text":"🔴 Bearish ","isUserVoted":false,"votesCount":43}],"totalVotes":168}},"attachments":[],"tags":[{"market":{"id":"100000","symbolName":"BTC","displayName":"Bitcoin","updated":"2026-09-01T07:44:49.182Z","assetType":"CryptoCoin","internalId":100000,"avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/btc/80x80.png","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/btc/90x90.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/btc/150x150.png","svg":{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/100000/100000_F0AF32_F7F7F7.svg","backgroundColor":"#F0AF32","textColor":"#F7F7F7"}},"application":"eToro","metadata":"","assetTypeId":10,"assetTypeSubCategoryId":1001}},{"market":{"id":"100001","symbolName":"ETH","displayName":"Ethereum","updated":"2026-09-01T07:44:49.182Z","assetType":"CryptoCoin","internalId":100001,"avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avata